{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p004644","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p004644"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p004644","label":"淖齒（田單列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"淖齒","mention_ids":["c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0151","c-shiji-082-tiandan:m008-0002"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0151","chapter_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p001","quote":"淖齒"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m008-0002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p008","quote":"淖齒"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-082-tiandan","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-082","chapter_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan","mention_count":2,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0151","c-shiji-082-tiandan:m008-0002"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-082-tiandan:p001","c-shiji-082-tiandan:p008"],"passage_count":2}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-082-tiandan"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"淖齒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004644","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p001","chapter_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m008-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"淖齒","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004644","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji082-005","person_id":"cbr-p004644","surfaces":["淖齒"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-082-tiandan"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p001","quote":"田單者，齊諸田疏屬也。湣王時，單為臨菑市掾，不見知。及燕使樂毅伐破齊，齊湣王出奔，已而保莒城。燕師長驅平齊，而田單走安平，令其宗人盡斷其車軸末而傅鐵籠。已而燕軍攻安平，城壞，齊人走，爭涂，以轊折車敗，為燕所虜，唯田單宗人以鐵籠故得脫，東保即墨。燕既盡降齊城，唯獨莒、即墨不下。燕軍聞齊王在莒，并兵攻之。淖齒既殺湣王於莒，因堅守，距燕軍，數年不下。燕引兵東圍即墨，即墨大夫出與戰，敗死。城中相與推田單，曰：「安平之戰，田單宗人以鐵籠得全，習兵。」立以為將軍，以即墨距燕。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p008","quote":"初，淖齒之殺湣王也，莒人求湣王子法章，得之太史嬓之家，為人灌園。嬓女憐而善遇之。後法章私以情告女，女遂與通。及莒人共立法章為齊王，以莒距燕，而太史氏女遂為后，所謂「君王后」也。"}],"rationale":"依9段明示姓名、君序與復齊事件暫接；法章立齊王與襄王迎莒、末段立襄王依同一復國敘事接。嬓女太史氏女君王后按明示，嬓與女先處完整稱謂。假神師是未名卒、臣其自稱，君指田單；燕將未名不盲接騎劫，宗族不補父母。誘王蠋授將被固謝，不當實授。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:p001","text":"田單者，齊諸田疏屬也。湣王時，單為臨菑市掾，不見知。及燕使樂毅伐破齊，齊湣王出奔，已而保莒城。燕師長驅平齊，而田單走安平，令其宗人盡斷其車軸末而傅鐵籠。已而燕軍攻安平，城壞，齊人走，爭涂，以轊折車敗，為燕所虜，唯田單宗人以鐵籠故得脫，東保即墨。燕既盡降齊城，唯獨莒、即墨不下。燕軍聞齊王在莒，并兵攻之。淖齒既殺湣王於莒，因堅守，距燕軍，數年不下。燕引兵東圍即墨，即墨大夫出與戰，敗死。城中相與推田單，曰：「安平之戰，田單宗人以鐵籠得全，習兵。」立以為將軍，以即墨距燕。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"田單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004641","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0004","start":4,"end":9,"surface":"齊諸田疏屬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未定角色或泛論保存；神為策略敘事，不補具名神祇或宗族親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"湣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004642","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"單","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004641","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"樂毅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004643","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0035","start":35,"end":38,"surface":"齊湣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004642","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-082-tiandan:m001-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface